# Deterministic line endings across platforms.
#
# The installer embeds payload files verbatim via //go:embed. A Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true (the GitHub runner default) would rewrite text files to
# CRLF, which (a) breaks byte-exact payload assertions in tests and (b) corrupts
# the DEPLOYED POSIX shell scripts (guard-*.sh, *-scan.sh) with a trailing ^M
# ("bad interpreter" at runtime). Force LF in the working tree on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: no EOL conversion, no textual diff.
*.png binary
